        "title": "Add provider routing for base3 and Projects subagent",
        "summary": "This commit extracts the base3 provider routing logic into a new exported function, `base3ProviderOptions`, in `agents/base3.ts`. The function ensures Anthropic models are routed to Amazon Bedrock with data collection disabled, while all other models disable data collection. The Projects subagent in `agents/projects-subagent.ts` now inherits this routing logic to match its root's data policy and prompt cache endpoint.",
        "significance": "notable",
