        "evidence": "The diff extracts the inline providerOptions logic from `createBase3` into a new exported function `base3ProviderOptions` in `agents/base3.ts` and adds a `providerOptions` field to the agent definition returned by `createProjectsSubagent` in `agents/projects-subagent.ts` by calling that new function.",
