        "calls": 1,
        "text": "The rule that decides which service handles a request is now a single, reusable instruction used by both the main assistant and the helper agents it spawns. This ensures that when you are using a specific AI model, the helper agents will use the exact same settings and data privacy rules as the main one. This is an internal update that keeps the assistant consistent across all its tasks; you will not see any new features or changes in your daily use.",
