        "title": "Ultra effort catalog flag expanded to option and default enum",
        "summary": "The server-driven Freebuff model catalog schema in `common` updates the `ultraEffort` field from a boolean to a string enum accepting `option` or `default`. This change supports the `ultra_effort_2026_12` experiment by distinguishing whether the reasoning slider merely offers Ultra as an option or starts there by default. The accompanying documentation clarifies that the `default` arm causes the slider to initialize at the Ultra level until the user selects another effort.",
