      "facts": [
        "Added 2026-11-26 with the role's starters (freebuff-starters.ts).",
        "Starters: the three things a new account is offered under its first composer, chosen by its onboarding role (`freebuff-onboarding.ts`).",
        "A click sends the starter's short `message`, which is all the transcript shows, with its `id` on the run. The server holds each id's playbook (`web/src/server/desktop-cloud/starter-playbooks.ts`): it has the agent ask one short question, offer the app the answer names, and then do the work.",
        "The playbook stays on the chat, so the turn after \"I connected Notion. Go ahead.\" still has it.",
        "Ids are stored on runs (`freebuff_cloud_run.request`), so they are append-only, as onboarding ids are: retire a starter by removing it from its role, never by renaming it.",
        "What the click sends, and what the transcript shows."
      ],
